concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-193 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "193 Author’s right of attribution of authorship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-193 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The author of a work has a right of attribution of authorship in respect of the work.  (2) The author’s right is the right to be identified in accordance with this Division as the author of the work if any of the acts (the attributable acts) mentioned in section 194 are done in respect of the work." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The author of a work has a right of attribution of authorship in respect of the work.  (2) The author’s right is the right to be identified in accordance with this Division as the author of the work if any of the acts (the attributable acts) mentioned in section 194 are done in respect of the work."@en ;
