concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-194 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "194 Acts giving rise to right of attribution of authorship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-194 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the work is a literary, dramatic or musical work, the attributable acts are the following:  (a) to reproduce the work in a material form;  (b) to publish the work;  (c) to perform the work in public;  (d) to transmit the work;  (e) to make an adaptation of the work.  (2) If the work is an artistic work, the attributable acts are the following:  Moral rights of authors  Schedule 1  (a) to reproduce the work in a material form;  (b) to publish the work;  (c) to exhibit the work to the public;  (d) to transmit the work.  (3) If the work is a cinematograph film, the attributable acts are the following:  (a) to make a copy of the film;  (b) to exhibit the film in public;  (c) to transmit the film." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the work is a literary, dramatic or musical work, the attributable acts are the following:  (a) to reproduce the work in a material form;  (b) to publish the work;  (c) to perform the work in public;  (d) to transmit the work;  (e) to make an adaptation of the work.  (2) If the work is an artistic work, the attributable acts are the following:  Moral rights of authors  Schedule 1  (a) to reproduce the work in a material form;  (b) to publish the work;  (c) to exhibit the work to the public;  (d) to transmit the work.  (3) If the work is a cinematograph film, the attributable acts are the following:  (a) to make a copy of the film;  (b) to exhibit the film in public;  (c) to transmit the film."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e97377bf812e7c0c66c2215523d123421b8e30bd82461b7c8eef7fd8e94e6105" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-194-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-194-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-194-ss-3 ;
