concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-194-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "194(3) Acts giving rise to right of attribution of authorship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-194-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the work is a cinematograph film, the attributable acts are the following:  (a) to make a copy of the film;  (b) to exhibit the film in public;  (c) to transmit the film." ;
