concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195ac a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "195AC Author’s right not to have authorship falsely attributed"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-195ac ;
    values:originalText "(1) The author of a work has a right not to have authorship of the work falsely attributed.  (2) The author’s right is the right not to have a person (the attributor) do, in respect of the work, any of the acts (the acts of false attribution) mentioned in the following provisions of this Division." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The author of a work has a right not to have authorship of the work falsely attributed.  (2) The author’s right is the right not to have a person (the attributor) do, in respect of the work, any of the acts (the acts of false attribution) mentioned in the following provisions of this Division."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f43c7d1a01726ed9324c74ee30cd804c1deaf7655dc8b1ed980fb63740af7f0a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
