doc:sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "195AW(5) Author’s consent to act or omission—films or works in films" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) A consent given for the benefit of the owner or prospective owner of copyright in the work or works to which it relates is presumed, unless the contrary intention appears in the consent instrument, to extend to his or her licensees and successors in title, and to any persons who are authorised by the owner or prospective owner, or by such a licensee or successor in title, to do acts comprised in the copyright. 195AWB  Consent invalidated by duress or false or misleading statements" ;
