doc:sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "195AW(1) Author’s consent to act or omission—films or works in films" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a person applies duress to an author, or to a person representing an author, in connection with the giving of a consent for the purposes of section 195AW or 195AWA, the consent does not have any effect." ;
