concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "195AZ(4) Actions for infringement of moral rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-195az-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) the work is a cinematograph film; and  (b) the action is brought by a person who is a screenwriter of the film; and  (c) the relief granted in the action consists of or includes damages; and  (d) the person has already been granted relief by way of damages in an action for an infringement of his or her moral rights as  Schedule 1  Moral rights of authors  an author of the dramatic work constituted by the script or screenplay for the film; the amount of any damages that, apart from this subsection, would be awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (b) is to be reduced by the amount of the damages awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (d)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If:  (a) the work is a cinematograph film; and  (b) the action is brought by a person who is a screenwriter of the film; and  (c) the relief granted in the action consists of or includes damages; and  (d) the person has already been granted relief by way of damages in an action for an infringement of his or her moral rights as  Schedule 1  Moral rights of authors  an author of the dramatic work constituted by the script or screenplay for the film; the amount of any damages that, apart from this subsection, would be awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (b) is to be reduced by the amount of the damages awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ca81b3a294bbfb49cae2a15b814b67476b07f747da74e2a1a8655565e2e47d39" ;
    values:partOf concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Federal Court of Australia has jurisdiction over matters arising under this Part. Reduction of damages for screenwriters in moral rights infringement actions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
