doc:sch-1-sec-195az-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "195AZ(4) Actions for infringement of moral rights" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) the work is a cinematograph film; and  (b) the action is brought by a person who is a screenwriter of the film; and  (c) the relief granted in the action consists of or includes damages; and  (d) the person has already been granted relief by way of damages in an action for an infringement of his or her moral rights as  Schedule 1  Moral rights of authors  an author of the dramatic work constituted by the script or screenplay for the film; the amount of any damages that, apart from this subsection, would be awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (b) is to be reduced by the amount of the damages awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (d)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "195AZ(5) Actions for infringement of moral rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-195az-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If:  (a) the work is a dramatic work constituted by the screenplay or script for a cinematograph film; and  (b) the action is brought by a person who is an author of the screenplay or script; and  (c) the relief granted in the action consists of or includes damages; and  (d) the person has already been granted relief by way of damages in an action for an infringement of his or her moral rights as a screenwriter of the film; the amount of any damages that, apart from this subsection, would be awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (b) is to be reduced by the amount of the damages awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (d)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If:  (a) the work is a dramatic work constituted by the screenplay or script for a cinematograph film; and  (b) the action is brought by a person who is an author of the screenplay or script; and  (c) the relief granted in the action consists of or includes damages; and  (d) the person has already been granted relief by way of damages in an action for an infringement of his or her moral rights as a screenwriter of the film; the amount of any damages that, apart from this subsection, would be awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (b) is to be reduced by the amount of the damages awarded to the person in the action referred to in paragraph (d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e88f27dfd83677e75605d1c185b54dc8b60ffeb6cfdfc7467556e22b11f51382" ;
    values:partOf concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az ;
