concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "195AZ(2) Actions for infringement of moral rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-195az-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a name purporting to be the name of the director, producer or screenwriter of a cinematograph film appeared on copies of the film that were issued when the film was made, then, in an action  Schedule 1  Moral rights of authors  brought under this Part, the person whose name so appeared is, if it was his or her true name or a name by which he or she was commonly known, presumed, unless the contrary is established, to be the director, producer or screenwriter, as the case may be, of the film. 195AZG  Other presumptions in relation to literary, dramatic, musical or artistic work  Sections 128 and 129 apply in respect of an action brought under this Part." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If a name purporting to be the name of the director, producer or screenwriter of a cinematograph film appeared on copies of the film that were issued when the film was made, then, in an action  Schedule 1  Moral rights of authors  brought under this Part, the person whose name so appeared is, if it was his or her true name or a name by which he or she was commonly known, presumed, unless the contrary is established, to be the director, producer or screenwriter, as the case may be, of the film. 195AZG  Other presumptions in relation to literary, dramatic, musical or artistic work  Sections 128 and 129 apply in respect of an action brought under this Part."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bca6fa706b1479a26d87d7350d9041cbaa194a5c50d57f072ac893ed80b117c0" ;
    values:partOf concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may consider factors when granting relief for moral rights infringement. Damages recovered in one proceeding are taken into account in assessing damages in another proceeding arising out of the same operation or transaction. Decision of a court is final. Presumption of authorship for film director, producer or screenwriter" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28" ;
    cml:asserts concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-2-norm .
